 "remarks": "Welcome to this move-in ready second-floor condo in the desirable Skyview complex, offering comfort, style, and convenience. This immaculate two-bedroom home has been freshly painted and features newer flooring and carpets throughout, creating a bright and inviting atmosphere. Relax by the cozy fireplace in the spacious living room or prepare meals with ease in the large kitchen, complete with newer appliances, a breakfast bar, and abundant cabinet space. The thoughtfully designed floor plan provides comfortable everyday living, while the included garage, private storage unit, and additional storage below the unit add exceptional functionality. Ideally situated near the West Norwalk border, this turnkey home offers low-maintenance living with easy access to shopping, public transportation, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway, making daily commuting and errands a breeze. Don't miss this wonderful opportunity to own an updated home in a highly convenient location.",
